          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ശുദ്ധീകരിക്കുക (śuddhīkarikkuka) is built from Sanskrit śuddha, \"clean, pure\" (Monier-Williams), with -īkaraṇa, making into, and the Malayalam verb ending."
